{
  "_comment": [
    "The /insights snapshot publisher: importers/publish_snapshot.py, and",
    "importers/daily_pull.py --publish. Copy this to reports/dashboard.json",
    "and fill it in -- the real one is gitignored, because it names people.",
    "",
    "Every name and id below is invented. The account ids are the shape",
    "Atlassian uses (a 24-character hex id, or the newer 712020:<uuid>), not",
    "anybody's. Read them out of reports/identities.txt, never guessed.",
    "",
    "No secret belongs in this file. The push is scp/ssh and uses your own",
    "key; the endpoint is handed derived counts and is never handed a",
    "credential -- it runs untrusted workflow code."
  ],

  "destination": "future:/home/ubuntu/aeris-insight/insights/insights.json",

  "weeks_back": 5,

  "prices": {
    "claude-sonnet-4.6": "3.0/15.0"
  },

  "members": [
    {
      "name": "Alex Example",
      "account_id": "0000000000000000000000aa",
      "short": "Alex",
      "role": "runs the tests and raises the bugs",
      "pronouns": "she"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sam Sample",
      "account_id": "712020:00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000bb",
      "role": "builds the automated tests",
      "pronouns": "he"
    }
  ]
}
